ues. By finding key items and solving puzzles, players can open sealed paths, overcome obstacles, and gradually uncover the truth behind the events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Real-Time Action Combat System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a fully ARPG-style real-time combat system. Enemies can appear at any moment during exploration, and players must make strategic use of weapons and skills to survive the dangers ahead.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Skill System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When facing powerful enemies, players can unleash special skills\u2014such as slowing down time to escape danger, or briefly entering an invincible state to turn the tide of battle\u2014adding layers of strategy and intensity to every encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decisions you make will alter the fate of the characters and the direction of the story, ultimately leading to one of five different endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Streaming &amp; Gameplay Footage Guidelines\u3011</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming and gameplay videos are allowed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We would greatly appreciate it if you could include the game\u2019s title in your stream/video title, or provide a link to the Steam page in the description.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are not responsible for any damages or issues arising from streaming or gameplay recordings.</p></li></ul>","developers":["SilverEyes"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914200/e6e86aa71b8b5b50f1ca96c3b517771cf592afb7/header.jpg?t=1768992753","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"m